abstract: "Python SDK for the Markarian Multiwavelength Data Center (MMDC, https://mmdc.am): retrieval of multiwavelength spectral energy distributions and light curves of blazars and other sources, on-demand Swift UVOT/XRT analysis, and broadband emission modeling of blazars with SSC, EIC and hadronic models."
